%N A399451 Total number of independent vertex sets in all labeled trees on n vertices.
%H A399451 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399451/b399451.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A399451 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/IndependentVertexSet.html">Independent Vertex Set</a>.
%o A399451 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=O(x)); for(n=1, n, my(t=x*exp(v)); v=x*exp(u+v); u=t); Vec(serlaplace(intformal((u + v)/x)))}
